{
  "id": "sec.bank.emandate",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "name": {
    "en": "NACH / e-mandate registration and recurring debits",
    "hi": "एनएसीएच / ई-अधिदेश पंजीकरण एवं आवर्ती नामे"
  },
  "domain": "Banking",
  "description": "Mandate registered with AFA (or a signed NACH form verified by maker and checker); every debit is its own linked case: pre-debit notice at least 24 hours before, customer opt-out, AFA above the no-AFA limit (Rs 15,000; Rs 1 lakh for mutual funds, insurance premium, card bills), debit by operationId, bounce handling; modification and revocation with AFA.",
